        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Add Reddit subreddit campaign utilities and promotion evasion checks",
        "summary": "Introduces a new module in `common/src/util/` containing helpers for Reddit campaigns that target a subreddit link instead of a fixed post. Defines `SUBREDDIT_CAMPAIGN_ACTIONS` to restrict valid actions to comment and post, and `parseSubredditUrl` to normalize various subreddit link formats into a canonical URL. Implements `subredditCampaign` to identify stored campaigns by their canonical link, action type, and preview author, and `promotionEvasionReason` to detect briefs requesting moderation evasion, extra accounts, or hidden sponsorship.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "advertisers",
        "evidence": "New file `common/src/util/reddit-campaign.ts` defines `SUBREDDIT_CAMPAIGN_ACTIONS`, `parseSubredditUrl`, `subredditCampaign`, `parseRedditThingUrl`, and `promotionEvasionReason`, which are asserted by the new test suite `common/src/util/__tests__/reddit-campaign.test.ts`.",
