        "title": "Desktop cloud runtime contract adds pending move state",
        "summary": "The `runtime` method of the `HostedWorkspaceHost` interface in `common/src/desktop-cloud/hosted-workspace.ts` gains an optional `pendingMove` field on its response type. This field tracks a move operation that started but did not finish, allowing the client to refuse other location changes until the pending move completes for that specific location and branch. Builds prior to November 18 omit this key, so the presence of `pendingMove` indicates a newer desktop client capable of handling incomplete state transitions.",
